Z||000000||Fiero5||10-22-2000||10:15 PM||||There is a place called Kick Hill Farms that is located in Lebanon CT. The owner, Bob Parker, has a HUGE 3 story barn full of professionally removed Fiero parts. He is constantly getting in large numbers of Fieros, that are only good for salvageable parts that his crew professionally dissesembles. <BR>If you want to see an absolutely awesome selection of Fiero parts at truly affordable prices, I highly recommend you go there.<P>Give Bob Parker a call or even better-stop by his place (9-5 M-F or call for an appointment  if a weekend or after 5pm)<BR>Bob Parkers KicK Hill Farms Fiero Parts number is: (860)-642-4362 and he is located at 464 Kick Hill Road Lebanon CT 06249<BR>Sincerely, Steve Kelley <A HREF="http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html</A>  ||||reg||14
Z||000001||TheFiero64||10-23-2000||12:37 PM||||Kick-hill farm is the best place in the whole wide world. I can spend 10 hours there and it seems like 10 min. Here are some pics of this Fiero candy land. <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=34313&a=8401398" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=34313&a=8401398</A> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif"> ||||reg||10
